OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CUK reservists contacted as 'threat     
OL,5,Cenvironment' rises, Streeting says     
OL,6,GThe Ministry of Defence has written to 
OL,7,Gex-military personnel to check their   
OL,8,Gcontact details and skills against the 
OL,9,Gbackdrop of a rising "threat           
OL,10,Genvironment", Defence Secretary Wes    
OL,11,GStreeting has said.                    
OL,13,FIt comes after The Times and the       
OL,14,FTelegraph reported that reservists who 
OL,15,Fpreviously served in the Armed Forces  
OL,16,Fhave received letters telling them to  
OL,17,Fprepare to be called up for war.       
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
